# Results: multinomial LR vs kNN on Iris (OpenML 61), 10 x stratified 5-fold CV

Produced by `report/code/` (`bash code/make_all.sh`); design `story-repo` `plan.md` D1-D6.
The local run is primary; the Ibex run is the replicate (identical, see below).

## Which file supports which claim

| Claim / item | File (fields) |
|---|---|
| Q1 mean accuracy of LR and kNN with 95% interval | `summary.json` -> `quantities.LR`, `quantities.kNN` -> `corrected_t.{mean,lo,hi,se,df}` |
| Q2 paired difference LR - kNN, 95% interval, covers 0? | `summary.json` -> `quantities.LR_minus_kNN.corrected_t`, `.corrected_t_covers_0`; win/tie/loss in `paired_fold_counts` |
